### GET all games for a current user
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesForUser?user=davidk&orderBy=ASC

### GET all games for a current user by platform
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesForUserByPlatform?user=davidknight&platform=PS5

### Create new user with their initial collection
POST http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/addNewGamesToNewUser?user=user1
content-type: application/json

{
  "user": {"username": "davidk","alias": "Squall", "email": "davidknight46@hotmail.com", "isAdmin": true},
  "newGame": [{"name": "Final Fantasy 16", "platform": "PS5", "rating": 5.0,"releaseDate": "2023-06-22", "isPreOrder": true, "isInterested": false, "genre": "J_RPG", "isCompleted": true}]
}

### Add an new game to existing user
POST http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/addAnNewGameForAnExistingUser?user=Squall
content-type: application/json

[
  {
    "name": "Tales of Arise",
    "platform": "PS5",
    "rating": 5.0,
    "releaseDate": "2021-09-10 00:00:00",
    "isPreOrder": false,
    "isInterested": true,
    "genre": "J_RPG",
    "isCompleted": true,
    "isOwned": true,
    "dlcs": [{"dlcName":"Beyond the Dawn", "releaseDate": "2023-09-11", "rating": 4.5}]
  }
]


### Change parameters for a game
PUT http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/updateGameInUserCollection?user=davidknight
content-type: application/json

[
  {"id": "66d12ac2e7d3aa4dd220bdf2",
    "gameToUpdate": "Exodus",
    "keyToUpdate": "isOwned",
    "newValue": false
  },
  {
    "id": "66d12ac2e7d3aa4dd220bdf2",
    "gameToUpdate": "Stellar Blade",
    "keyToUpdate": "isOwned",
