]

### Get all games that were pre-orders
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesIsPreOrder?isPreOrder=true&user=davidknight

### Get all games that are completed
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesIsCompleted?isCompleted=true&user=davidknight

### Get all games by genre
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesByGenre?genre=J_RPG&user=davidk

### Get all games not released
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesNotReleased?user=davidk

### Get all games owned
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/gamecontroller/getAllGamesUserOwns?user=davidk

### Remove user
DELETE http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/admincontroller/deleteUser?user=yangzhou
isAdmin: false

### Add DLC
POST http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/dlccontroller/addAnDLC?user=davidk
content-type: application/json

{
  "gameName": "Final Fantasy 16",
  "dlcName": "Echoes of the Fallen",
  "releaseDate": "2023-12-11",
  "rating": 5.0
}

### Get Game DLC
GET http://localhost:9006/api/v1/docs/dlccontroller/getDLCForGame?user=davidk&game=Final Fantasy 16
